# Wifecraft's demo: "A Day in Dalaran". Its own story, not the game's.
# People: alleria, nyrelle (and her nightsaber, saber), you (the player), narrator.
# Places and their marks: assets/places.json. Emotes: talk, exclaim, question, bow, wave, cheer,
# laugh, rude, kiss, cry, shy, point, salute, yes, no, applaud, flex, roar.

alleria +10
nyrelle +10

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Prologue
fadeout 0
scene overlook day
music dawn 0
letterbox on
shot view sweep_a
fadein 1500
shot view sweep_b 9000
wait 2600
title Wifecraft | A Day in Dalaran
wait 2400
narrator: Dalaran floats above the Broken Isles again. Argus is dark in the sky, and the Legion is broken.
narrator: You came to the city of mages for a quiet week, {name}. Dalaran has never been quiet.
fadeout 900

scene krasus day
music alleria 2500
cast alleria rail face out
cast you arrive face rail
shot view landing
fadein 900
walk you near 3200
shot view behind 3200
wait 3300
face alleria you
shot bust alleria 900
letterbox off
wait 500

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter I
title Chapter I | Morning
alleria [talk]: You've been staring at the Isles for a while. First time seeing them from above?
choice What do you say?
  > Is it that obvious? | alleria +5 | goto a_obvious
  > Honestly? I was looking at you. | alleria +10 | goto a_bold
  > Who's asking? | goto a_wary
end

:a_obvious
alleria [laugh]: Only to someone who's stood here a hundred times. The view never gets any smaller.
goto a_name
:a_bold
alleria [laugh]: Honest, at least. Most of Dalaran would have pretended otherwise.
alleria [talk]: I find I don't mind it.
goto a_name
:a_wary
alleria [question]: Careful. In this city, the question is usually the expensive part.
goto a_name

:a_name
alleria [bow]: Alleria Windrunner, ranger of Quel'Thalas.
alleria [talk]: Lately, a guest of the Light, and of something less polite. The Void tends to follow me.
you: {name}. I got in this morning.
alleria [point]: Then a lesson Dalaran teaches the hard way: watch the streets. Not everything running through them has two legs.
choice How do you leave it?
  > I'll be careful. Will I see you again? | alleria +10
  > I can look after myself. | alleria +5
end
alleria [talk]: I'm on the Landing most mornings. My sister keeps a house in the city, and I keep out of it while she works.
fadeout 700

scene street day
music day 1500
cast you mid face north
cast saber start face you
shot view street
fadein 600
letterbox on
wait 400
sound saber_roar
run saber past 900
shot view street_low 500
wait 650
sound saber_pounce
shake 500
emote you no
wait 500
cast nyrelle behind face you
music nyrelle 2000
run nyrelle close 1400
shot two nyrelle you 1200
wait 1500
face nyrelle you
letterbox off
shot bust nyrelle 700
nyrelle [exclaim]: Elune's mercy! Don't try to get up yet. Are you hurt?
nyrelle [talk]: I'm glad you're okay. You hit your head pretty badly!
choice What do you say?
  > I've taken worse hits in training. | nyrelle +5 | goto n_sword
  > Your cat owes me an apology. | nyrelle +10 | goto n_cat
  > Keep that animal on a leash. | nyrelle -5 | goto n_leash
end

:n_sword
nyrelle [laugh]: A fighter. Good. Half of Dalaran would still be lying on the cobbles, calling for a healer.
goto n_name
:n_cat
nyrelle [laugh]: She is not a cat. Please don't say that where she can hear you.
nyrelle [shy]: ...But yes. She owes you one. So do I.
goto n_name
:n_leash
nyrelle [no]: A Sentinel's saber is no one's pet. She walks beside me because she chooses to.
nyrelle [talk]: Still, she shouldn't have run you down. I'm sorry.
goto n_name

:n_name
nyrelle [bow]: Nyrelle Moonquill, of the Sentinels. A long way from Darnassus, and quite lost among the mages.
nyrelle [talk]: This city hums. Every stone is soaked in arcane magic, and my people have good reason to fear that.
nyrelle [question]: You seem at home here, though. Would you show me it isn't all dangerous?
choice What do you say?
  > Gladly. We'll start with something sweet from the market. | nyrelle +10
  > It's mostly dangerous. That's half the fun. | nyrelle +5
  > Ask a mage. They love explaining things. | nyrelle -5
end
nyrelle [laugh]: Then I'll find you again, {name}. Or she will. She's better at it.
fadeout 800

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter II
scene plaza day
music day 2000
cast you centre face steps
shot view plaza
fadein 800
title Chapter II | Afternoon
choice Where do you spend the afternoon?
  > Walk Krasus' Landing with Alleria. | goto alleria_day
  > Help Nyrelle find her runaway saber. | goto nyrelle_day
  > Wander the city on your own. | goto alone_day
end

# ---- Alleria's afternoon
:alleria_day
set route_alleria
fadeout 700
scene krasus dusk
music dusk 2000
cast alleria rail face out
cast you near face rail
shot view behind
fadein 900
wait 600
face alleria you
shot bust alleria 900
alleria [talk]: You came. Most people find the Landing too quiet. I've come to like that about it.
alleria [question]: Tell me something. When I look out there, what do you think I see?
choice What do you think she sees?
  > Everything you fought to protect. | alleria +10
  > Everything you lost. | alleria +5
  > The way home. | alleria +20
end
alleria [talk]: Some of each. I spent a very long time fighting beyond the stars. The world I came back to had moved on without me.
alleria [talk]: And the Void I carry likes to whisper that I belong nowhere. It's lying. It usually is.
choice What do you say?
  > You belong here. Today, at least. | alleria +20
  > Then I'll keep you company until it goes quiet. | alleria +10
  > Maybe you should get some rest. | alleria +0
end
alleria [laugh]: Kind words. I've had little practice receiving them.
alleria [talk]: The Violet Citadel has a terrace that catches the stars. Meet me there tonight.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---- Nyrelle's afternoon
:nyrelle_day
set route_nyrelle
fadeout 700
scene plaza day
music nyrelle 2000
cast nyrelle steps face you
cast you centre face steps
cast saber hide face you
shot bust nyrelle
fadein 800
nyrelle [exclaim]: There you are! She's gone again. She hates portals, and the whole city is portals.
nyrelle [question]: If you were a nightsaber who'd had enough of mages, where would you hide?
choice Where do you look?
  > Somewhere high, where she can watch everyone. | nyrelle +10 | goto n_high
  > Somewhere warm, near the food stalls. | nyrelle +20 | goto n_warm
  > Just call her name. | nyrelle +5 | goto n_call
end
:n_high
nyrelle [yes]: She does love a rooftop. Let's look up, then.
goto n_found
:n_warm
nyrelle [laugh]: You've definitely met her.
goto n_found
:n_call
nyrelle [talk]: Shadowpaw only comes when she wants to. Like every cat. Do not tell her I said that.
goto n_found
:n_found
letterbox on
shot view plaza_wide 1200
sound saber_alert
walk saber found 2200
wait 2300
face nyrelle saber
emote nyrelle cheer
wait 1500
face nyrelle you
letterbox off
shot two nyrelle you 900
nyrelle [laugh]: Found her! Or she found us. With her, it's never clear.
nyrelle [shy]: Thank you, {name}. I expected this city to be cold. It isn't, with you in it.
choice What do you say?
  > I'm glad she knocked me over. | nyrelle +20
  > Any time. She knows where to find me now. | nyrelle +10
  > Maybe keep her closer next time. | nyrelle +0
end
nyrelle [talk]: Come to the Violet Citadel's terrace tonight. The moon shows from there. Elune's light.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---- Wandering alone
:alone_day
fadeout 700
scene street day
cast you mid face north
shot view street
fadein 800
narrator: You wander. Dalaran's streets curl around you: mages arguing, merchants calling, the smell of fresh bread.
narrator: Twice you think you see a ranger's green cloak. Once, a flash of a nightsaber's tail.
choice Do you follow either?
  > Follow the green cloak. | alleria +5
  > Follow the nightsaber. | nyrelle +5
  > Keep wandering. | set wanderer
end
narrator: The afternoon slips away before you notice it go.
fadeout 900
goto night

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter III
:night
title Chapter III | Night
if flag route_alleria goto night_alleria
if flag route_nyrelle goto night_nyrelle
goto night_alone

:night_alleria
scene terrace night
music alleria2 2500
cast alleria partner face view
cast you arrive face partner
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
walk you beside 2500
shot two alleria you 2500
wait 2600
face alleria you
face you alleria
shot bust alleria 900
alleria [talk]: You came.
alleria [talk]: From up here the city looks made of starlight. It's easy to forget it's made of people.
if alleria >= 60 goto alleria_romance
if alleria >= 20 goto alleria_friend
goto alone_end

:alleria_romance
alleria [talk]: I've spent years listening to a voice that lies to me.
alleria [talk]: You haven't. Not once. That's rare enough that I'd like to keep it close.
choice What do you do?
  > Take her hand.
  > Stand closer, and say nothing.
end
letterbox on
shot two alleria you 1600
emote alleria bow
wait 1800
emote you kiss
wait 1600
fadeout 1600
ending windrunner

:alleria_friend
alleria [talk]: Thank you for today, {name}. You'd make a decent ranger: you notice things.
alleria [salute]: If the Void gets loud again, I'll know where to find a friend.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2000
wait 2000
fadeout 1400
ending arrows

:night_nyrelle
scene terrace night
music moon 2500
cast nyrelle partner face view
cast saber lie face view
cast you arrive face partner
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
walk you beside 2500
shot two nyrelle you 2500
wait 2600
face nyrelle you
face you nyrelle
shot bust nyrelle 900
nyrelle [talk]: There. Do you see her? Elune's light, even above a city of mages.
if nyrelle >= 60 goto nyrelle_romance
if nyrelle >= 20 goto nyrelle_friend
goto alone_end

:nyrelle_romance
nyrelle [shy]: My people say the moon watches over the ones we choose.
nyrelle [talk]: I think I'd like her to watch over you too. With me.
choice What do you do?
  > Kiss her.
  > Tell her you choose her too.
end
letterbox on
shot two nyrelle you 1600
emote nyrelle kiss
wait 1800
emote saber roar
wait 1400
fadeout 1600
ending moonlight

:nyrelle_friend
nyrelle [laugh]: Shadowpaw has decided you're one of us now. You're stuck with both of us.
nyrelle [wave]: Goodnight, {name}. Thank you for showing me the city isn't all danger.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2000
wait 2000
fadeout 1400
ending saber

:night_alone
scene terrace night
music night 2500
cast you beside face view
shot view terrace_wide
fadein 1000
goto alone_end

:alone_end
narrator: The city glows beneath you. Somewhere below, someone laughs. Somewhere, a portal hums.
narrator: Tomorrow, perhaps. Dalaran will still be here.
letterbox on
shot view terrace_wide 2500
wait 2500
fadeout 1400
ending strangers
